    1	"""
    2	MPS Bond Dimension of the Prime Indicator
    3	==========================================
    4	
    5	Quantum-inspired complexity test. View the binary prime indicator
    6	chi_P(n) for n in [1..2^k] as a state vector in (C^2)^{otimes k}.
    7	A state with low entanglement has small TT (matrix-product-state)
